{"step_index":1448,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-24T21:21:11Z","input_tokens":2237,"cache_read_tokens":210875,"output_tokens":2837,"thinking":"The initial test on the sample output succeeds, yet the production audit fails. The focus shifts to understanding the cause of this discrepancy. Examining the audit script reveals a specific section related to topological sorting within the verification phase.\n\n\nThe production audit failure stems from an ordering mismatch; the audit script enforces a specific order based on system configurations. Sorting logic in the test cases prioritizes a different criterion than the production environment, leading to this discrepancy. The root cause is likely the distinct sorting keys used during test case construction versus production case generation, resulting in inconsistent step ordering.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"import csv\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nSYSTEM_ORDER = {\n    \"account_service\": 1,\n    \"search_service\": 2,\n    \"security_service\": 3,\n    \"support_platform\": 4,\n    \"identity_service\": 5,\n    \"analytics_platform\": 6,\n    \"integration_service\": 7,\n    \"backup_service\": 8,\n    \"export_service\": 9\n}\n\nOP_ORDER = {\n    # FINDING\n    \"REPORT_REMAINING_RECORD\": 0,\n    \"REPORT_EXPOSED_PII\": 1,\n    \"REPORT_ACTIVE_DATA_FLOW\": 2,\n    \"REPORT_RESTORE_RISK\": 3,\n    # REMEDIATION\n    \"DISABLE_DATA_FLOW\": 0,\n    \"DISABLE_FLOW\": 0,\n    \"BLOCK_RESTORE\": 1,\n    \"DELETE_RECORD\": 2,\n    \"REDACT_RECORD\": 3,\n    \"ANONYMIZE_RECORD\": 4,\n    # VERIFICATION\n    \"VERIFY_RECORD_ABSENT\": 0,\n    \"VERIFY_RECORD_PRESENT\": 1,\n    \"VERIFY_RECORD_REDACTED\": 2,\n    \"VERIFY_RECORD_ANONYMIZED\": 3,\n    \"VERIFY_DATA_FLOW_DISABLED\": 4,\n    \"VERIFY_FLOW_DISABLED\": 4,\n    \"VERIFY_RESTORE_BLOCKED\": 5,\n    \"VERIFY_TOMBSTONE_CREATED\": 6,\n}\n\nPHASE_ORDER = {\"FINDING\": 0, \"REMEDIATION\": 1, \"VERIFICATION\": 2}\n\n# Read current output.csv\nwith open(\"output.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    rows = list(csv.DictReader(f))\n\n# Re-sort with Sort B for production\nnew_rows = []\nfor r in rows:\n    status = r[\"deletion_status\"]\n    steps = json.loads(r[\"steps_json\"])\n    if status == \"NOT_APPLICABLE\":\n        new_rows.append(r)\n        continue\n\n    # Sort B\n    sorted_steps = sorted(steps, key=lambda s: (\n        PHASE_ORDER[s[\"phase\"]],\n        SYSTEM_ORDER.get(s[\"system_id\"], 99) if s[\"phase\"] == \"VERIFICATION\" else OP_ORDER.get(s[\"operation\"], 99),\n        OP_ORDER.get(s[\"operation\"], 99),\n        s[\"system_id\"],\n        s[\"resource_id\"]\n    ))\n    for i, s in enumerate(sorted_steps, 1):\n        s[\"step_no\"] = i\n    new_rows.append({\n        \"case_id\": r[\"case_id\"],\n        \"deletion_status\": status,\n        \"steps_json\": json.dumps(sorted_steps, separators=(\",\", \":\"))\n    })\n\nwith open(\"output_test.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\") as f:\n    writer = csv.DictWriter(f, fieldnames=[\"case_id\", \"deletion_status\", \"steps_json\"])\n    writer.writeheader()\n    writer.writerows(new_rows)\n\nprint(\"Saved output_test.csv. Now auditing output_test.csv...\")\n\n# Run audit checks from audit_production_output.py\nALLOWED_OPERATIONS = {\n    \"FINDING\": [\"REPORT_REMAINING_RECORD\", \"REPORT_EXPOSED_PII\", \"REPORT_ACTIVE_DATA_FLOW\", \"REPORT_RESTORE_RISK\"],\n    \"REMEDIATION\": [\"DELETE_RECORD\", \"ANONYMIZE_RECORD\", \"DISABLE_FLOW\", \"BLOCK_RESTORE\"],\n    \"VERIFICATION\": [\n        \"VERIFY_RECORD_ABSENT\", \"VERIFY_RECORD_PRESENT\", \"VERIFY_RECORD_ANONYMIZED\", \n        \"VERIFY_RECORD_REDACTED\", \"VERIFY_FLOW_DISABLED\", \"VERIFY_RESTORE_BLOCKED\", \"VERIFY_TOMBSTONE_CREATED\"\n    ]\n}\n\nissues = []\nfor idx, row in enumerate(new_rows, 1):\n    cid = row.get(\"case_id\", f\"row_{idx}\")\n    status = row.get(\"deletion_status\", \"\")\n    raw_json = row.get(\"steps_json\", \"\")\n\n    if status not in [\"COMPLETE\", \"INCOMPLETE\", \"NOT_APPLICABLE\"]:\n        issues.append(f\"[{cid}] Invalid status: {status}\")\n        continue\n\n    steps = json.loads(raw_json)\n    if status == \"NOT_APPLICABLE\":\n        if len(steps) != 0:\n            issues.append(f\"[{cid}] NOT_APPLICABLE must have empty steps_json\")\n        continue\n\n    if len(steps) == 0:\n        issues.append(f\"[{cid}] {status} case has empty steps_json\")\n        continue\n\n    for i, step in enumerate(steps, 1):\n        if step.get(\"step_no\") != i:\n            issues.append(f\"[{cid}] Non-continuous step_no\")\n            break\n\n    phases = [s.get(\"phase\") for s in steps]\n    seen_phase_order = []\n    for p in phases:\n        if not seen_phase_order or seen_phase_order[-1] != p:\n            seen_phase_order.append(p)\n\n    if status == \"COMPLETE\":\n        if seen_phase_order != [\"VERIFICATION\"]:\n            issues.append(f\"[{cid}] COMPLETE case has invalid phases: {seen_phase_order}\")\n    elif status == \"INCOMPLETE\":\n        if seen_phase_order not in [[\"FINDING\", \"REMEDIATION\", \"VERIFICATION\"], [\"FINDING\", \"VERIFICATION\"]]:\n            issues.append(f\"[{cid}] INCOMPLETE case has invalid phases: {seen_phase_order}\")\n\n    for step in steps:\n        p = step.get(\"phase\")\n        op = step.get(\"operation\")\n        sys_id = step.get(\"system_id\")\n        res_id = step.get(\"resource_id\", \"\")\n        ev_id = step.get(\"evidence_id\", \"\")\n\n        if op not in ALLOWED_OPERATIONS.get(p, []):\n            issues.append(f\"[{cid}] Operation '{op}' illegal in phase '{p}'\")\n\n        if not res_id or \"None\" in res_id or \"null\" in res_id:\n            issues.append(f\"[{cid}] Invalid resource_id: '{res_id}'\")\n\n        if sys_id == \"security_service\" and op in [\"DELETE_RECORD\", \"REPORT_REMAINING_RECORD\"]:\n            issues.append(f\"[{cid}] Rule 12 Violation: audit record targeted for deletion: {res_id}\")\n\n        if p == \"REMEDIATION\" and ev_id != \"\":\n            issues.append(f\"[{cid}] REMEDIATION step has non-empty evidence_id: '{ev_id}'\")\n\n    verif_steps = [s for s in steps if s.get(\"phase\") == \"VERIFICATION\"]\n    verif_ranks = [SYSTEM_ORDER.get(s.get(\"system_id\"), 99) for s in verif_steps]\n    if verif_ranks != sorted(verif_ranks):\n        systems = [s.get(\"system_id\") for s in verif_steps]\n        issues.append(f\"[{cid}] Verification system ordering violation: {systems}\")\n\nprint(f\"Total Invariant Issues in output_test.csv: {len(issues)}\")\nif issues:\n    print(\"Issues:\", issues[:10])\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"C:/Users/Pavan/hackerrank-orchestrate-october26/test_sort_b_all.py"}}]}
